  "description": "Stateless lookup of localized user-facing messages from a caller-supplied translation table. Resolves a key against a locale with fallback through language-only locale, then English, then the raw key. No I/O, no globals, no DI.",
  "id": "JTigerNova.jtiger.lang",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-20T21:33:51.747Z",
